  "claim_short": "Full affirmative solution to Kempka--Vybiral Remark 4(i): the hypothesis that p^+ is finite can be removed from the real-interpolation identity (L_{p(.),q_0(.)},L_infinity)_{theta,q}=L_{p(.)/(1-theta),q}. The proof covers the source's full quasi-Banach exponent class p,q_0 in P(R^n), including p^- and q_0^- below 1, p=infinity on positive measure, q=infinity, and q_0^-=infinity. It replaces generalized inverses by...",
